Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:53.26,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,54)\fad(200,0)\fnRoundHog SemiBold\fs34\c&H001CCEFF}Alex Jung (Unikraft)
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:53.26,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Launch often: every new
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:53.26,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}feature and every raise got
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:53.26,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}its own launch”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,so we launch often
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:01.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,or at least at the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:02.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:03.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,we were always
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:03.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,launching.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:04.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,I mean, we had like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:05.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,launch weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:06.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,We would just say like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:07.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,oh, new features?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:08.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's launch week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,We would just call it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:09.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,something like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,oh, this is what we're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,doing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:12.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even though it was like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:13.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,three months had passed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,people forget that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:15.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:15.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,you had previously
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:16.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,you don't have to launch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:17.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,once, you don't have to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:18.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,and we raised multiple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:19.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,times, so every time we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,raised, we launched
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:22.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,again, we had new
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,features to come out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:24.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,now we're a lot more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:25.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,stable in terms of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:25.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,features
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:25.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,I mean, very early on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:26.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,we were still just like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:27.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,okay, now we landed this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:28.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,because we had the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:29.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,cycles, and whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:30.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,a client comes along
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:30.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,maybe it shifts a little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:32.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,bit the roadmap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,but, launching often
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:35.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think, and having
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:35.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,these campaigns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:36.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,they work quite well in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,terms of bringing people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:39.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,in. I've noticed sending
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:40.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,out, oh, this is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:41.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,special one-time event
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:43.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,and having people come
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:44.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,along, maybe this actual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,real physical event as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:46.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,well that kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:46.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,complements it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:48.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,in terms of maybe you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:48.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,doing something every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:50.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,week, and then the last
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:50.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Friday, for example
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:51.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,you're actually hosting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:51.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,an event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:53.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,That worked really well.
